# Pedal to the Metal cast after blockers: X = 1 makes Bot1's blocked Grizzly Bears a 3/2 with first strike (CR 702.7b), so it deals
# 3 to Bot2's Hill Giant in the first-strike damage step and the Giant dies before it deals its regular damage: the Bears survive.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Pedal to the Metal
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hill Giant
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Hill Giant.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Hill Giant > Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pedal to the Metal.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears; X: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Hill Giant
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Pedal to the Metal
Bot2.Life = 20
